  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "44",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu eyi kambuŋami Yakoba, eyi Isarela natondi, tiyaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wakutuŋaili, wakuwumbili kufumisha hiwafumini mwivumu, wakakukwashaŋaku, nindi, Eyi kambuŋami Yakoba, eyi Yeshuruni natondi, bayi wutiyaloŋa womaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa nakechila meji hadi wudinampwila, niheseki dawuma nakechilahu tuloŋa twameji. Nakechila Spiritu yami hadi anyaneyi, ninkisu yami nakayichila hadi iwakavwala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, Mwanta waIsarela, nkúuli yindi Yehova wamazaza, nindi, Yami watachi, yami wankumininaku; hikwekala Nzambi wacheŋuku, yami hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyi wudi neyi ami wakwila atambika, ashimuna, achinloŋeshela kufumisha hinatoŋweleli antu akushankulu? Ashimuni yumayakenza niyamba kamwekana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wutiya woma hela kwakamaku; hinakushimwina dehi kunyakaku? Hina kulejeli chuku? Enu yenu ayinsahu jami. Ochu kudi Nzambi wacheŋi wakulunjika kudami? Mwalala hikudi Ilola dacheŋuku. Hineluka kwami dacheŋuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakwila akishi akusoŋa wejima wawu amukunkulwayi, yuma yawu yatiyilaŋawu chipepa hiyakamwenamu chumaku; ayinsahu jawu awenawu hiyamonaŋaku, hiyelukaku; kulonda akatiyi nsonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyi wawumbahu dehi mukishi wumu hela kusupununa mukishi wumukwasha hela hanti? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, akwawu ejima adibombaŋa nayena akatiya nsonyi; akwawukalawenu avwalika kudi antu hohu. Apompi wejima wawu, emani; akati yawoma, nikutiyila nsonyi hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchi hakwila chizembi, hakuchizakasaha makala, hakuchichila nanyisensi, hakuchikalakala nachikasa chindi chaŋovu. Mwalala, yena watiyapa nzala, nikuzeya wazeyaloŋa. Chákubulayi kunwa meji jina mukapi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwakusoŋa hakutanjika mwonji, hakuyifunda nansonekesu, hakuyisoŋa namapalana, hakuyifunda nayuma yakukelubula nachu, hakusoŋa mwekalila muntu mwekalila lubanjilwa muntu, kulonda yishakami mwitala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watemaŋa nyisida yindi, wanonaŋa musesi namukula, wadikoleshelaŋa mutondu wamwisaŋa wumu. Watumbaŋa munjunŋa, nvula hiyikuwukulisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiwukwikala nchawaja muntu; muntu hakunonaku hakwota, mwalala hakubutula, hakwocha dinkendi; mwalala hakuwila mukishi windi, hakudifukula kudi yena; hakuwila mukishi wakusoŋa, hakudimbukilaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibalu chimu hakuchocha mukesi; kuchibalu chikwawu hakudiilaku mbiji, hakwocha yakwocha, hakwikuta, mwalala hakwota ni kesi, hakwila nindi, Eyo, natiyi dehi iyena, namoni dehi kesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikushalaku hakuchila mukishi windi, yowu mukishi windi wakusoŋa. Hakudimbukilaku, hakudifukula, hakulombaku nindi, Nkwachiluku, muloŋa eyi yeyi mukishi wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyelukaku, hiyatoŋojokaŋa chachiwahuku, muloŋa yena najimi dehi mesu awu kulonda akabuli kumona, ninyichima yawu, kulonda akabuli kushinshika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwosi wukutiya ke-su kumuchima, hela kwiluka, hela kushinshika mwakwila nindi, Nochi dehi chibalu chimu mukesi, mwalala nochi dehi nidinkendi hamakalachu; mwalala, nochi dehi nimbiji, nadyi dehi nikudya; chinashali nili chishimashima? Nidimbukili tuhu kuchikunku chamutondu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wudi nakudya kwindi mawuti, muchima wadimbanaŋa wowunamuteŋululi dehi hambadi; mwaka akaŋanyi kupulwisha wumi windi, hela kwila nindi, Ichi chidi muchikasa chami chachidiilu hichakutwambaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yakoba, eyi Isarela, anukapa yumiyi, muloŋa eyi wukambuŋa ami, yami nakuwumbili, eyi wukambuŋa ami. Eyi Isarela, hinakakuvulamenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyiloŋa yeyi nayijimaŋeshi dehi neyi chakujima nevu dashishita, nshidŋeyi najŋimaŋeshi dehi neyi chakujima nevu; funtaku kudami muloŋa yami nakukúuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mawulu, imbenu tumina, muloŋa Yehova diyinachikoŋa. Enu mashina amaseki, dikuwenu. Enu mapidi, nineyi isaŋa, ninyitondu yejima yekalamu, vwakukenu nakwimba tumina, muloŋa Yehova nakuuli dehi Yakoba, wakamwekesha lubanji lwindi muIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, nkúuli yeyi, wakuwumbili kufumisha hiwafumini mwivumu, nindi, Yami Yehova naleŋaŋa yuma yejima; natanjikaŋa mawulu kankawami, naalaŋa maseki; nekala nanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mansuka aketulaŋa awu akwakutwamba wayilishaŋa mukunkulwayi tuhu, wazalukishaŋa kwakuhoŋa. Wafuntishaŋa kwamaana hanyima, wasupishaŋa yelukawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakoleshaŋaazu dakambuŋindi, welapa mwaya mpùŋa yawatuŋanda twindi; watenaŋa Yerusalema nindi, Mwakashakama antu; watenaŋa nyikalaya muYuda nindi, Akayituŋa, mahembawu nakayihizumwisha cheŋi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "welaŋa inyiŋa nindi, Umaku, nituŋa tweyi nukutúumisha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nateni Kirusi nindi, Hikabiŋa kami, diyi wakawanisha mwejima munatiya kuwaha; nateni nawa Yerusalema nindi, Akamutupa; nateni tembeli nindi, Akaala chikuku cheyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
